{"id":"43afe63c-e5e5-4d2b-8436-12c9703d7ba7","revision":0,"last_node_id":49,"last_link_id":78,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-420],"size":[3500,360],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Arbor · Continuous shots from keyframes — FastH3 OmniRef (MiniMax H3, 8 steps)\n\nSix keyframes of one moment, in story order, become five clips that run into each other: clip 1 goes from keyframe 1 to keyframe 2, clip 2 from 2 to 3, and so on — the last frame of each clip is the first frame of the next.\n\n1. **List Item** `:-1` takes every keyframe but the last (the first frames), `1:` every keyframe but the first (the last frames). **Tree to Data** turns both into lists of five that line up one by one.\n2. Each pair goes into **MiniMax H3 Reference to Video** as `<Picture 1>` and `<Picture 2>`, and two **Add Guide** nodes pin them to the first frame (0) and the last frame (-1) of the clip.\n3. **Prompt Template** (*zip*) writes one structured OmniRef prompt per transition from a **motion** line and a **sound** line — five lines each, in order. FastH3 OmniRef renders picture **and** sound in **8 steps**; keep **Model Sparse Attention** on *vsa* (keep 10 %) and **SigmaShift** at 12 / 3.\n4. **Save by Path** writes the clips with their names (`output/arbor/h3_continuous/01 → 02.mp4 …`) and **Concatenate Video** joins them into one sequence.\n\nClips are 124 frames (~5 s) at 0.4 MP to keep the demo quick — raise the resolution for real shots. Use your own keyframes with **Add…** on Load Media: any number, in order (n keyframes → n − 1 clips), with one motion and one sound line per transition."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Arbor · Continuous shots from keyframes — FastH3 OmniRef (MiniMax H3, 8 steps)\n\nSix keyframes of one moment, in story order, become five clips that run into each other: clip 1 goes from keyframe 1 to keyframe 2, clip 2 from 2 to 3, and so on — the last frame of each clip is the first frame of the next.\n\n1. **List Item** `:-1` takes every keyframe but the last (the first frames), `1:` every keyframe but the first (the last frames). **Tree to Data** turns both into lists of five that line up one by one.\n2. Each pair goes into **MiniMax H3 Reference to Video** as `<Picture 1>` and `<Picture 2>`, and two **Add Guide** nodes pin them to the first frame (0) and the last frame (-1) of the clip.\n3. **Prompt Template** (*zip*) writes one structured OmniRef prompt per transition from a **motion** line and a **sound** line — five lines each, in order. FastH3 OmniRef renders picture **and** sound in **8 steps**; keep **Model Sparse Attention** on *vsa* (keep 10 %) and **SigmaShift** at 12 / 3.\n4. **Save by Path** writes the clips with their names (`output/arbor/h3_continuous/01 → 02.mp4 …`) and **Concatenate Video** joins them into one sequence.\n\nClips are 124 frames (~5 s) at 0.4 MP to keep the demo quick — raise the resolution for real shots. Use your own keyframes with **Add…** on Load Media: any number, in order (n keyframes → n − 1 clips), with one motion and one sound line per transition."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":2,"type":"Arbor_LoadMedia","pos":[0,0],"size":[420,363],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"文件","name":"files","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"files"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"文件","name":"files","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[]},{"localized_name":"图片","name":"images","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[60,61]},{"localized_name":"视频","name":"videos","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null},{"localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null},{"localized_name":"文件名","name":"names","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":null}],"title":"Keyframes · in story order","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_LoadMedia"},"widgets_values":["arbor:sequence/01.jpg\narbor:sequence/02.jpg\narbor:sequence/03.jpg\narbor:sequence/04.jpg\narbor:sequence/05.jpg\narbor:sequence/06.jpg"],"widgets_values_named":{"files":"arbor:sequence/01.jpg\narbor:sequence/02.jpg\narbor:sequence/03.jpg\narbor:sequence/04.jpg\narbor:sequence/05.jpg\narbor:sequence/06.jpg"}},{"id":3,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[0,403],"size":[420,400],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"识别数值","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"整段文本","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"数据树","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[56]}],"title":"Motion · one line per transition","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["The camera glides in along the wooden pier toward her; she lifts the paper lantern and strikes a match, and a small flame catches inside.\nThe camera pushes in to a close-up as the flame grows; warm light fills the thin paper and spreads across her face as she raises the lantern.\nThe camera tilts up as she lifts the glowing lantern above her head and lets it go; it rises just past her open fingertips.\nThe camera cranes back behind her as the lantern drifts up over the lake to join the others, their reflections shimmering on the water.\nThe camera rises high above the lake as hundreds of lanterns float up into the starry sky; the pier and her silhouette grow small below.",false,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"The camera glides in along the wooden pier toward her; she lifts the paper lantern and strikes a match, and a small flame catches inside.\nThe camera pushes in to a close-up as the flame grows; warm light fills the thin paper and spreads across her face as she raises the lantern.\nThe camera tilts up as she lifts the glowing lantern above her head and lets it go; it rises just past her open fingertips.\nThe camera cranes back behind her as the lantern drifts up over the lake to join the others, their reflections shimmering on the water.\nThe camera rises high above the lake as hundreds of lanterns float up into the starry sky; the pier and her silhouette grow small below.","parse_numbers":false,"multiline":false,"arbor_panel":""}},{"id":4,"type":"Arbor_Panel","pos":[0,843],"size":[420,230],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":7,"type":"*","link":null},{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"识别数值","name":"parse_numbers","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"parse_numbers"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"整段文本","name":"multiline","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"multiline"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"数据","name":"data","shape":6,"type":"*","links":null},{"localized_name":"数据树","name":"tree","type":"ARBOR_TREE","links":[57]}],"title":"Sound · one line per transition","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Arbor_Panel"},"widgets_values":["Water lapping softly against the pier, a light evening breeze, the scratch and flare of a match.\nThe soft crackle of the flame, thin paper rustling, crickets along the shore.\nA gentle rush of warm air, a quiet breath, still water.\nWind over the lake, faint distant voices of people releasing lanterns.\nA soft night breeze, a distant temple bell, the hush of the lake at night.",false,false,""],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"Water lapping softly against the pier, a light evening breeze, the scratch and flare of a match.\nThe soft crackle of the flame, thin paper rustling, crickets along the shore.\nA gentle rush of warm air, a quiet breath, still water.\nWind over the lake, faint distant voices of people releasing lanterns.\nA soft night breeze, a distant temple bell, the hush of the lake at night.","parse_numbers":false,"multiline":false,"arbor_panel":""}},{"id":8,"type